---
import PlatformShell from '../platform/PlatformShell.astro';
import product from '../../product.json';
---
<PlatformShell title="表单" active="forms" open>
  <section class="p-card">
    <h2>一起把校园补完整</h2>
    <p>谁都能看，登录后提交。提了建议我们会看；照片和资料审核后放进地图和课表，大家都用得上。</p>
    <div class="p-actions" style="margin-top:16px">
      <a class="p-button" href={`/fill/?id=${product.forms.feedback}`}>意见反馈</a>
      <a class="p-button" href={`/fill/?id=${product.forms.place}`}>地点拍照</a>
      <a class="p-button" href={`/fill/?id=${product.forms.data}`}>非教务数据上传</a>
      <a class="p-button secondary" href="/submissions/">查看我的提交</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</PlatformShell>
